BT /F1 15 Tf 42 238 Td (Practical differences) Tj ET
0.24 0.29 0.34 RG
0.97 0.98 0.99 rg
42 74 755 145 re B
0.22 0.13 0.1 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 58 197 Td (Without trigger logging) Tj ET
0.18 0.16 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 58 178 Td (- Logs are application behavior, not database behavior.) Tj ET
0.18 0.16 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 58 166.5 Td (- Direct SQL changes are invisible unless the caller logs manually.) Tj ET
0.18 0.16 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 58 155 Td (- A missed Log\(...\) call means the change is not traceable.) Tj ET
0.18 0.16 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 58 143.5 Td (- DebugEvents disappear when the app restarts.) Tj ET
0.18 0.16 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 58 132 Td (- Does not clearly satisfy the assignment requirement for a log table.) Tj ET
0.04 0.23 0.1 rg
BT /F1 12 Tf 438 197 Td (With trigger logging) Tj ET
0.12 0.18 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 438 178 Td (- Logs are enforced by MariaDB whenever tracked rows change.) Tj ET
0.12 0.18 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 438 166.5 Td (- Insert, update, and delete activity is written automatically.) Tj ET
0.12 0.18 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 438 155 Td (- database_activity_log remains available after restart.) Tj ET
0.12 0.18 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 438 143.5 Td (- The DB Activity tab can show an audit trail from the table.) Tj ET
0.12 0.18 0.14 rg
BT /F1 9 Tf 438 132 Td (- Matches: Log table + triggers + stored procedures.) Tj ET
